# ECHO — environment variables
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# EVERYTHING HERE IS OPTIONAL. The app is 100% functional with an empty
# environment: all five catalogue sources (AniList, Kitsu, TVMaze,
# IMDb/Cinemeta, RAWG, Open Library) work out of the box with zero setup.

# Optional — Google Gemini API key for the AI features (Ask ECHO,
# Taste Companion, weekly digest, synopsis translation).
# Free key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# Without it, AI features degrade gracefully and everything else works.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional — pin a single Gemini model instead of the default free chain
# (gemini-3.8-flash -> gemini-3.5-flash-lite).
# GEMINI_MODEL=

# Optional — future growth swap point, see src/lib/echo/server/kv.ts.
# Free tier: https://upstash.com
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
